mily:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Thank you for making a competent biogeographic tool BioGeoBEARS! It really helps for my phylogeographic analyses.</span><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Please add me to the google group and post the question I have here:</span><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">How could I change the default colors for plotting per area?</span><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Ideally, I would like to something like:</span><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">get_colors_for_numareas</span><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">…...</span><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">                area_colors = c(“my chosen color 1&quot;, &quot;my chosen color 2&quot;, &quot;my chosen color 3&quot;, &quot;my chosen color 4&quot;, &quot;my chosen color 5&quot;)</span><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">……</span><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Thank you very much!</span><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Regards,</span><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Rui</span><br></div></blockquote></div></div></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
