     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi -- running out the door, but briefly, you would add a line like this to the script:<div><br></div><div>colors_list_for_states  = c(&quot;white&quot;, &quot;red&quot;, &quot;green&quot;, &quot;blue&quot;)</div><div># (that would be for a 4-state problem)</div><div><br></div><div># For 350 states:</div><div><div style=\"font-size:small\">colors_list_for_states  = c(&quot;white&quot;, &quot;red&quot;, &quot;green&quot;, &quot;blue&quot;, rep(&quot;grey50&quot;, times=346))</div># ...which repeats &quot;grey50&quot; for the last 346 colors<br><br></div><div># Look at the colors list:</div><div><span style=\"font-size:small;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);float:none;display:inline\">colors_list_for_states</span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size:small;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);float:none;display:inline\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:small;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);float:none;display:inline\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:small;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);float:none;display:inline\"># Then you add the colors list to the <span style=\"float:none;display:inline\">plot_BioGeoBEARS_results</span> command:</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:small;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);float:none;display:inline\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);float:none;display:inline\"><div># States</div><div>res2 = plot_BioGeoBEARS_results(results_object, analysis_titletxt, addl_params=list(&quot;j&quot;), plotwhat=&quot;text&quot;, label.offset=0.45, tipcex=0.7, statecex=0.7, splitcex=0.6, titlecex=0.8, plotsplits=TRUE, cornercoords_loc=scriptdir, include_null_range=TRUE, tr=tr, tipranges=tipranges, <span style=\"font-size:small;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);float:none;display:inline\">colors_list_for_states=<span style=\"float:none;display:inline\">colors_list_for_states</span></span>)</div><div><br></div><div># Pie chart</div><div>plot_BioGeoBEARS_results(results_object, analysis_titletxt, addl_params=list(&quot;j&quot;), plotwhat=&quot;pie&quot;, label.offset=0.45, tipcex=0.7, statecex=0.7, splitcex=0.6, titlecex=0.8, plotsplits=TRUE, cornercoords_loc=scriptdir, include_null_range=TRUE, tr=tr, tipranges=tipranges<span style=\"font-size:small;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);float:none;display:inline\">,<span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:small;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);float:none;display:inline\">colors_list_for_states=<span style=\"float:none;display:inline\">colors_list_for_states</span></span><span style=\"font-size:small;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);float:none;display:inline\">)</span></div></span></div><div><br></div><div>Cheers,</div><div>Nick</div><div><br></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
